# Tests

- Behavior over private implementation; arrange/act/assert.
- Naming: `test_<behavior>_when_<condition>_<expected>`.
- Backend: mock ports/interfaces; PostGIS integration against real DB in CI/Compose.
- Mobile: fake repositories; targeted widget tests; few integration/goldens.
- Bug fixes need regression tests.
- Frontend / client-input API changes: include security regressions
  (injection payloads as ordinary strings, oversized input, XSS-like content
  treated as data, authZ negatives when private resources exist).
- Guides: `python-testing-guide.md`, `flutter-testing-guide.md`,
  `security/security-testing-guide.md` in tourism-platform/docs.
